# Postpositions that follow a holiday name and mark it as a date: "क्रिसमस
# पर" (on Christmas), "नए साल तक" (until New Year).  Hindi postpositions
# follow the noun.  Sources: native answer, chronologia#1484 (comment
# 7209012484); en.wiktionary.org, entry "पर", postposition "on, at";
# entry "तक", postposition "until, up to".  पर is also the conjunction
# "but", so it licenses a holiday only after the name, never before it.
पर
तक
